# CQ12 [Substructure & mooring] How are mooring systems classified by duration and configuration?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?mooring ?classification WHERE {
  ?mooring a ?classification .
  ?classification rdfs:subClassOf optimar:MooringSystem .
}
